What variables from which files are you comparing? I cannot follow your question.

Vignette paragraph 4.3 https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/GGIR/vignettes/GGIR.html#output-part-5  gives guidance for variable meanings.

Note that sedentary behavior is not calculated by GGIR. GGIR only gives inactive behavior split up in sustained inactivity and other inactivity. It is up to you to call this sedentary behaviour, but given that we do not estimate sitting time it wouldn't sound logical to me to call it sedentary behavior.

Vincent

