I have been working on various enhancement to GGIR, especially related to part 5, which will be part of the GGIR version 2.0 release later this month or early May.

If you want to already try out the beta version GGIR then please do:
install.packages("devtools")
install_github("wadpac/GGIR", ref = "GGIR2.0")
This will install the development version of GGIR.

Note this is not a stable version yet, or in other words I am still editing it every week, but if you could try it and let me know if the warnings remain/disappear then that would be very helpful.

Thanks, Vincent

