Hi Dominika,
Yes, because the issue made it impossible for part 2 to complete it's work when too many variables were requested. If you generated part 5 results before than these will not be affected. Needless to say that this is a development branch and I have been working on part 4 and 5 in recently. So, there may be other reasons why results have changed (for the better). I am almost finished with my preparation for release 2.0. It is mostly updating the documentation now: https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR/issues/278
Best,
Vincent

